1
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:43,400
Mr. Fang

2
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:48,000
What if the glasses fall in the water?

3
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:48,959
Shut up.

4
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,239
Got it! I got it!

5
