283
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:14,440
Say no more.

284
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,080
Say no more.

285
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,559
To Grandpa!

286
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,320
To Grandpa!

287
00:14:17,759 --> 00:14:18,279
Well,

288
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,159
speaking of Grandpa...

289
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:19,799
I just remembered something.

290
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:21,799
Grandpa just came to me in a dream.

291
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,440
He said, "Anything you do is fine,

292
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,879
but you shouldn't have used the stun baton

293
00:14:24,879 --> 00:14:26,279
to zap that poor kid!"

294
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:27,519
I regret it so much!

295
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:29,120
I don't think Grandpa is right.

296
00:14:30,399 --> 00:14:32,519
Edison invented alternating current.

297
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,799
Brother used electricity to talk to me.

298
00:14:35,279 --> 00:14:36,519
My parents gave birth to me.

299
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:39,440
Brother gave me a second life, so...

300
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:42,919
Brother...

301
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:45,960
S-sorry about that.

302
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,799
Brother is my Second parents!

303
00:14:48,799 --> 00:14:49,559
To Brother!

304
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:50,679
Say no more.

305
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:52,080
Well said!

306
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:54,720
Right on!

307
00:14:55,039 --> 00:14:55,799
Mr. Fang.

308
00:14:55,799 --> 00:14:57,320
No need, sit down, sit down.

309
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:59,679
For what I did the other day,

310
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:01,440
the bad things...

311
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,799
I apologize, little brother.

312
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:04,559
I'm sorry.

313
00:15:06,039 --> 00:15:06,600
Brother!

314
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,320
Lean your forehead over here.

315
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,320
This... this...

316
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,120
Brother loves you! Brother loves...

317
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,799
Brother loves me.

318
00:15:18,919 --> 00:15:19,679
I love Brother too!

319
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:21,679
Slow down, slow down. Easy, easy.

320
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,080
A fight makes the best of friends.

321
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,039
Come on, let's drink!

322
00:15:27,039 --> 00:15:28,600
You're a great brother to me!

323
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:29,559
You are...

324
00:15:29,799 --> 00:15:32,200
Grandpa!

325
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:35,720
You are my Second parents!

326
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:39,279
I'll dedicate an old song to Brother.

327
00:15:49,879 --> 00:15:51,080
Just listen to me.

328
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,159
Just stay here, and that's it.

329
00:15:53,279 --> 00:15:53,919
Brother.

330
00:15:53,919 --> 00:15:55,639
I have lots to handle back home, Brother.

331
00:15:55,639 --> 00:15:57,639
Alright then. I'll drive you.

332
00:15:57,639 --> 00:15:58,759
No, Brother. No need to see us out.

333
00:15:58,759 --> 00:16:00,159
Please don't see us out, Brother.

334
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,919
We'll just stroll back.

335
00:16:01,919 --> 00:16:03,679
A nice walk will help me digest.

336
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:04,399
Alright.

337
00:16:04,519 --> 00:16:05,320
Then take this...

338
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:07,200
Take this stuff. Take it.

339
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,559
What's all this for?

340
00:16:08,559 --> 00:16:09,080
What for?

341
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:12,039
Come back often to see me and Grandpa.

342
00:16:12,039 --> 00:16:13,799
I must come back often just for Grandpa.

343
00:16:13,799 --> 00:16:14,919
Don't worry, Brother.

344
00:16:16,759 --> 00:16:17,799
I'll miss you.

345
00:16:17,799 --> 00:16:19,799
Love you, Brother! Love you!

346
00:16:19,799 --> 00:16:20,559
Come back!

347
00:16:20,559 --> 00:16:21,279
Love you! Love you!

348
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:23,200
Come back! Come back! Come back!

349
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:23,679
Come back!

350
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:25,159
Love you guys, big bro's boys!

351
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:26,360
Brothers, we're off!

352
00:16:27,159 --> 00:16:28,679
Goodbye, Brother!

353
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:30,919
Come visit often!

354
00:16:31,279 --> 00:16:32,600
Bye-bye!

355
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:47,080
Brother, can you slow down a bit?

356
00:16:47,399 --> 00:16:49,120
I can't keep up with you.

357
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,559
Who are you calling brother?

358
00:16:53,519 --> 00:16:54,480
How could you throw it away?

359
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,840
Brother! Brother! Brother!

360
00:17:00,399 --> 00:17:01,200
Where is this brother?

361
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:01,679
Where's this brother at?

362
00:17:01,679 --> 00:17:02,440
Who's your brother?

363
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,559
Where's the suicide note?

364
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:06,039
What do you want the suicide note for?

365
00:17:06,039 --> 00:17:06,799
None of your business.

366
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:07,680
Come on, give me the suicide note.

367
00:17:09,039 --> 00:17:11,119
Do you still want to die?

368
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,160
I'll do whatever I want.

369
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,039
It has nothing to do with you.

370
00:17:13,039 --> 00:17:14,279
Come on, give me the note.

371
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:16,119
Give me the note.

372
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,079
Brother Bin!

373
00:17:23,319 --> 00:17:27,279
Mr. Fang... Mr. Fang, Mr. Fang, Mr. Fang!

374
00:17:27,279 --> 00:17:28,000
Where's the note?

375
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,400
Aren't you all better now?

376
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,160
What do you mean better?

377
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,720
I lied to you, and you believed it?

378
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,279
Shock me. Right, right.

379
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:36,880
Shock me! Shock me! Shock me!

380
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:38,119
You're shocking me! Shocking me, right?

381
00:17:38,119 --> 00:17:39,039
You're shocking me!

382
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,400
Where's the note?

383
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,680
I'm going to tell Brother Bin.

384
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:50,880
You're telling Brother Bin?

385
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,920
Who is your Brother Bin?

386
00:17:52,119 --> 00:17:53,279
They're just a bunch of criminals.

387
00:17:53,839 --> 00:17:54,880
They use vigilante justice.

388
00:17:55,279 --> 00:17:56,079
And you're their accomplice.

389
00:17:57,119 --> 00:18:00,200
"A mother's greatest pain is childbirth."

390
00:18:02,359 --> 00:18:02,799
Come here, let me see.

391
00:18:02,799 --> 00:18:03,200
Come here, let me see.

392
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:03,720
How does it hurt?

393
00:18:04,279 --> 00:18:04,799
How does it hurt?

394
00:18:04,799 --> 00:18:07,200
Does it hurt? Does it hurt? Does it hurt?

395
00:18:07,519 --> 00:18:07,920
It hurts!

396
00:18:08,799 --> 00:18:10,359
Give me the note! Give it to me!

397
00:19:06,079 --> 00:19:07,079
When drawing the bow,

398
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,319
I lock my eyes on the bullseye.

399
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:14,119
For this moment,

400
00:19:16,119 --> 00:19:17,200
I've waited too long.

401
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,759
So much so that

402
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:24,480
my eyes magnify the bullseye 1,000 times,

403
00:19:25,759 --> 00:19:26,599
so much so that

404
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:29,720
a canyon is carved between my brows,

405
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,599
so much so that

406
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,799
my chest

407
00:19:35,519 --> 00:19:37,759
is cracked by my pounding heart.

408
00:19:58,319 --> 00:19:59,519
Release.

409
00:20:03,279 --> 00:20:04,160
I have no arrows.

410
00:20:05,759 --> 00:20:06,400
Because

411
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,880
I shot myself.

412
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,279
Mr. Fang!

413
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,519
Is anyone there?

414
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:33,119
Is anybody out there?!

415
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:29,640
Hello? Is anyone here?

416
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,200
How did you get in?
